From: Alessandro Astone <alessandro.astone@canonical.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Feb 2026 14:56:50 +0100
Subject: Move new symbol out of public library

As part of this patchset, we're backporting a new function
`sd_session_get_extra_device_access` which will be exported to libsystemd in
version 260. We don't want to export the symbol in out backport to version 258,
so move its definition (and one helper function) to its only user, udevd.

Forwarded: not-needed, downstream-only temporary patch
Bug-GNOME: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-remote-desktop/-/issues/224
Bug-Ubuntu: https://launchpad.net/bugs/2077538
---
